{"version":"2026.10.11-r25","id":"Q1070576","formula":"FeAl₆(PO₄)₄(OH)₈·4H₂O","hill":"Al6FeH16O28P4","elements":["H","O","Al","P","Fe"],"composition":{"H":16.0,"O":28.0,"P":4.0,"Al":6.0,"Fe":1.0},"names":{"en":"Aheylite","uk":"Ахейліт"},"descriptions":{"en":"Aheylite is a rare phosphate mineral with formula (Fe2+Zn)Al6[(OH)4|(PO4)2]2·4(H2O). It occurs as pale blue to pale green triclinic crystal masses. Aheylite was made the newest member of the turquoise group in 1984 by International Mineralogical Association Commission on New Minerals and Mineral Names.","uk":"Ахейліт — рідкісний фосфатний мінерал із формулою (Fe2+Zn)Al6[(OH)4|(PO4)2]2·4(H2O). Зазвичай трапляється у вигляді триклінних кристалічних мас з кольором від блідо-блакитного до блідо-зеленого. У 1984 році Комісія Міжнародної мінералогічної асоціації з нових мінералів і назв мінералів визнала ахейліт найновішим членом групи бірюзи."},"fame":16,"pubchemCid":null,"mass":null,"charge":0,"smiles":null,"inchikey":null,"iupac":null,"classes":[{"qid":"Q12089225","names":{"en":"mineral species","ru":"действительный вид минералов","uk":"мінеральний вид"}}],"structureInfo":null,"structure":null,"sources":[{"role":"identity","name":"Wikidata","url":"https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q1070576","license":"CC0 1.0"},{"role":"description","name":"Wikipedia (en)","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Aheylite","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0"},{"role":"description","name":"Wikipedia (uk)","url":"https://uk.wikipedia.org/wiki/%D0%90%D1%85%D0%B5%D0%B9%D0%BB%D1%96%D1%82","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0"},{"role":"photo","name":"Wikimedia Commons","url":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Aheylite-Cassiterite-177845.jpg","license":"CC BY-SA 3.0"}],"similar":[{"id":"Q165254","formula":"CuAl₆(PO₄)₄(OH)₈·4H₂O","names":{"en":"Turquoise","ru":"Бирюза","uk":"Бірюза"},"elements":["H","O","Al","P","Cu"],"fame":87,"kind":"crystal"},{"id":"Q3740332","formula":"ZnAl₆(PO₄)₄(OH)₈·4H₂O","names":{"en":"Faustite"},"elements":["H","O","Al","P","Zn"],"fame":9